    },
    {
      "id": "friend",
      "speaker": "アオイ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "aoi",
      "text": "……うん。そう、だね。友達、だもんね。",
      "avatars": {
        "aoi": {
          "expression": "sad"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_friend_d4916eab.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "アオイの笑顔が、雨の向こうで少しだけ滲んで見えた。",
      "nextSceneId": "end"
    },
    {
      "id": "hentai",
      "text": "透けそうで透けない、その絶妙な――。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "speaker": "アオイ",
      "speakerCharacterId": "aoi",
      "text": "……タカシくん？ どこ見てるの？",
      "camera": "close",
      "avatars": {
        "aoi": {
          "expression": "angry"
        }
